rsync
Usage: rsync -a [--delete] SRC DEST   (DEST may be user@HOST:path)

Syncs files or whole trees, copying only what changed -- so a second run is
fast and a broken transfer resumes. Over ssh it is how you pull loot back or
push a payload out.

	-a            archive: recurse, keep perms/times/links
	-z            compress in transit
	-P            show progress and keep partial files (resumable)
	--delete      make DEST match SRC exactly (removes extras)

See also: zstd, age
